%% title: My coordination: what is not done, and who to remind
%% desc: An admin makes a teacher a coordinator. On My coordination, a section with attendance not taken leads to its attendance sheet, a pending mark sheet leads to the mark sheet, and Notify teachers sends one reminder to the chosen teachers.
flowchart LR
  A["Admin<br/>makes a coordinator"]:::admin --> M["My coordination"]:::teacher
  M --> N["Not taken"]:::note --> R["Attendance sheet<br/>(read only)"]:::note
  M --> P["Marks pending"]:::note --> G["Mark sheet<br/>(read only)"]:::note
  M --> T["Notify teachers"]:::teacher --> W["Chosen teachers<br/>get a reminder"]:::note
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
